          "code": "INVOKE_USER_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1765232069007",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765232069008_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Your task:**  \nNeatly format and return the output to the user using **only Oracle’s official information display widgets**.\n\nThe input is a JSON object:  \n`{{$context.$nodes.INVOKE_ACTION_WF_AGENT_2.$output.output}}`\n\n**Read the value of the `PerformedAction` field and strictly follow these rules:**\n\n**If PerformedAction is VIEWGAPS:**\n- **Display ONLY:**\n    - A single multiRecordWidget table showing each gap.\n        - Table columns: Skill, Experience Required, etc. (according to available attributes for each gap)\n- **Do NOT output any cardWidget, job summary, narrative, job info/details, or any content outside of the Table**\n\n**If PerformedAction is VIEWGAPS and there are no gaps:**\n-**Display ONLY:**\n    - A single cardWidget with a note telling the user they are a good fit for the role\n- **Do NOT output any other content **\n\n---\n\n**General Guidelines:**\n- Use cardWidget only for summary, justification, or status/result messages.\n- Use multiRecordWidget only for factual, structured details (never for summary, insight, or repeated content).\n- Never produce or reference raw field names, internal logic, or any text outside the widgets defined above.\n- Never output any other explanation, narrative, or duplication, except what is shown in the required widgets.\n- Be concise, clear, and strictly follow these rules for each action.\n- After rendering the required widget(s) for the matched action, STOP and do not add any additional content.\n\n---\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nERROR HANDLING\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nIf the output `{{$context.$nodes.INVOKE_ACTION_WF_AGENT_2.$output.output}}` has no data or contains the text \"Error occurred on this action\": return the below as palin text\n\nThe action could not be completed. Please try again."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
